data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","item_id":"rs_09d63e8c3cc0a246016acd346a9cd087d1a84ee1e385974fee","output_index":0,"sequence_number":310,"summary_index":2,"text":"**Enhancing GET data submission**\n\nI'm thinking about creating a coherent approach for progressive enhancement with GET data auto-submit forms. I need to ensure that hidden fields with the same names across forms are appropriately modified while excluding visible ones. \n\nThe GET auto-select form controls should retain their state. When I fetch the response, I need to parse and replace the list while also considering the error handling and the container ID. I should abort any other submissions to keep things clean. Plus, I need to run browser tests to confirm that everything meets the expected source requirements."}

